Scenario: View No Website Notification For New Blogs Entry
Priority: 4
	Given NotificationsPortlet goto Notification Delivery
	When AssertElementPresent at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And IFrame select Configuration Frame
	And NotificationsPortlet disable User Deliveries
		|actionType|Add|
		|contentType|Blogs|
		|notificationType|Website|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Blogs subscribe PG
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
