Scenario: View Website Notification For New Comment Via Blogs
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	When Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment subscribe PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment add
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|1|
	And Notifications goto Notifications
	And Notifications view New Comment
		|assetType|comment|
		|content|Blogs Entry Title|
		|contentBody|Blogs Entry Comment|
		|user|userfn userln|
	And Notifications navigate To Content
		|contentBody|Blogs Entry Comment|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntryComment view PG
		|commentCount|1|
		|entryComment|Blogs Entry Comment|
		|userFullName|userfn userln|
	Then Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|

